T*
(when available, and the bundled fallback still catches common provider token families when) Tj
T*
(gitleaks is not installed. Reports and console output are redacted. The hook is versioned) Tj
T*
(and documented, so reviewers can pull the fork and reproduce the guardrail easily.) Tj
